WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:14.598
Dr. Brain is a drama about the
human desire and curiosity

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:17.518
in wanting to look into
other people's brains.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:20.395
We've all been curious
about what other

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.521
people are thinking and feeling.

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:26.568
This primal curiosity
has now evolved,

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:32.616
into the synchronization
using quantum entanglement.

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:38.121
Maybe it's a dream like feeling

00:00:38.372 --> 00:00:39.540
and you can't remember it.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:42.042
That's the kind of
approach I took.

00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:47.673
As is the case with
many actors in Korea,

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:51.260
working with director
Kim Jee-Woon,

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.054
especially for people around my
age, I have loved his work since

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.682
I was in my twenties.

00:00:56.682 --> 00:01:00.060
I grew up watching those works,
and since he is a director I

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:05.148
respect so much, I think it was
an honor to just work with him.

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.150
I think all productions
are very similar to the

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.735
director who directs them.

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:11.363
But especially for this
show, Go Sewon seems

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.365
a bit similar to the director.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.244
A little blunt,

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:18.537
but very deep...

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.747
Sewon, we're all going out for
- I'll pass

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:25.168
I've seen many of
director Kim's work 

00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:29.756
and I also like many
of them as well.

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.758
While working with
him, I was surprised

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:38.724
by the degree of detail
and sensitivity he had.

00:01:38.724 --> 00:01:41.727
I realized that his
great works were

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:44.313
a result of that part of him,

00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:45.897
that was great fun.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:48.483
Also, because he's
familiar with science

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:53.196
fictions mysteries
and family movies.

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:54.990
I think the director
is very for this kind

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.491
of work where complex
genres are mixed.

00:01:56.491 --> 00:02:02.205
I think the director is very
optimized for this kind of work.

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:10.130
I think the director's
thoughts, feeling, colors

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:14.134
and smells exist
in every scence.

00:02:15.218 --> 00:02:19.222
From the artwork,clothing,
props, hair, and makeup

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:25.270
he looks at every detail
of character or the setting

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:32.527
with great detail, so it will be
an unforgettable experience.

